  IMPLEMENTS: Complete computation slice algorithm (Tsantalis/Chatzigeorgiou 2009/2011)
  and object state slice identification for Java methods.
  
  CODE SMELLS ADDRESSED:
    - Feature Envy → Move Method
    - Type Checking → Replace Conditional with Polymorphism
    - Long Method → Extract Method
    - God Class → Extract Class
    - Duplicated Code → Extract Clone
  
  EXTRACT METHOD IMPLEMENTATION:
    Uses PDG-based complete computation slicing. Enumerates all possible code slices for
    all local variables in a method. Applies behavior preservation rules. Presents candidates
    to developer.
  
  MEMORY: JVM requires Xmx4096m for large projects.
  
  NOTE: Does not expose standalone API for cohesion metrics; coupled to Eclipse IDE.
<<<END>>>

